bject 2> sits at his desk and speaks to <Subject 3>. <Subject 3> slams the desk, grabs <Subject 4>, and storms out of the room. In the doorway, she turns back toward off-screen <Subject 2>, points her finger threateningly while holding <Subject 4>, yells a warning, and slams the door. <Subject 2> mutters to himself in response.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in all shots): fully_preserved - the office layout, pillars, and wallpaper are retained.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - the man's identity, hair, and attire are retained (he remains off-screen in [Shot 3]).\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): fully_preserved - the young woman's identity and appearance are retained.\n<Subject 4> (appears in [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): fully_preserved - the specific white phone design is retained.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is in a cinematic live-action style.\n[Shot 1] A medium close-up frames <Subject 2> seated behind his large wooden desk in the middle of <Subject 1>. He leans forward slightly, maintaining direct eye contact across the desk with a tense jaw. The camera holds a static shot. <Subject 2> (S1) speaks with an exasperated tone: <d>[English] No you can't just livestream russian roulette online, i dont care how many views it would get.</d>\n[Shot 2] At 00:04.200, the camera cuts to a slightly wider angle, revealing <Subject 3> seated opposite him. Her brow is deeply furrowed, and her mouth is pressed into a tight line. Immediately after <Subject 2> finishes speaking, she stands up abruptly, pushing her chair back, and slams her right hand down hard onto the wooden desk. She turns sharply, grabs <Subject 4> from the desk surface, and begins to walk aggressively toward the exit.\n[Shot 3] At 00:08.500, the camera cuts to a medium close-up shot framing <Subject 3> in the heavy office doorway, keeping <Subject 2> strictly off-screen. As she steps into the doorway, she abruptly halts and turns her body back toward the off-screen direction of <Subject 2>. Her expression is furious. While holding <Subject 4> securely in her right hand, she extends her index finger, pointing threateningly toward <Subject 2> off-camera. <Subject 3> (S2) yells indignantly: <d>[English] I'm tweeting about this! You're gonna get so canceled grandpa!</d> Immediately after speaking, she spins around and pulls the door shut with tremendous force.\n[Shot 4] At 00:11.800, the camera cuts back to a medium shot of <Subject 2> at his desk in <Subject 1>. The camera shakes slightly from the physical impact of the door slam. <Subject 2> stares at the closed door, rolls his eyes, purses his lips, and emits a sharp burst of air. <Subject 2> (S1) says: <d>[English] Pfft!</d> He then leans back into his chair, rubs his forehead with his right hand, and looks down. <Subject 2> (S1) mutters under his breath: <d>[English] Fucking bitch... teenagers...</d> The shot holds on his resting posture as his lips close tightly and his speaking motion ceases at the end of the video.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nThe low ambient hum of an air conditioner plays continuously. A resonant, wooden thud occurs when the desk is slammed, followed by sharp, rapid footsteps on a carpeted floor. A distinct creak sounds as the door opens, followed by a loud, solid slam that briefly echoes in the room. Clear exhalations and breathing sounds accompany the character's physical reactions.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A"],"color":"#322","bgcolor":"#533"},{"id":148,"type":"LoraLoaderModelOnly","pos":[-1405.6014932033247,4710.424075161767],"size":[534.3334484575057,90.69517922557588],"flags":{},"order":17,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"model","name":"model","type":"MODEL","link":296},{"localized_name":"lora_name","name":"lora_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"lora_name"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"strength_model","name":"strength_model","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"strength_model"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized